  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Green_Smoothie?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Green_Smoothie.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211171507\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Green smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Green smoothie</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 66</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 320</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  45 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 38</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Smoothie Mixer</span><span title=\"Smoothie mixer\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/smoothie-mixer-11369\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Smoothie Mixer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 89</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">38 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Green smoothies</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 66.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making green smoothies</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Smoothie_Mixer.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925211208\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Smoothie Mixer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Smoothie Mixer</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Green smoothies are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/smoothie-mixer-11369\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smoothie Mixer</a>.\n</p><p>To make a smoothie, players need the following ingredients in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lettuce-8898\" title=\"Lettuce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lettuce\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-10426\" title=\"Lemon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/apple-2241\" title=\"Apple\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Apple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 45 minutes to make one smoothie, and 38 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> mixer. Each smoothie gives players 38 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling green smoothies</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Green smoothies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,204 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 smoothies.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make a smoothie costs 292 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 green smoothies per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Green Smoothie is the only product that requires Apple, that doesn't have \"Apple\" in the name.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-smoothie-mixer-products-11432\" title=\"Category:Smoothie Mixer Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smoothie Mixer Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/berry-smoothie-11417\" title=\"Berry Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Berry Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-sesame-smoothie-31937\" title=\"Black Sesame Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Sesame Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cocoa-smoothie-29363\" title=\"Cocoa Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cocoa Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cucumber-smoothie-30754\" title=\"Cucumber Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cucumber Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/mixed-smoothie-24936\" title=\"Mixed Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mixed Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/plum-smoothie-29911\" title=\"Plum Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/tropical-smoothie-35569\" title=\"Tropical Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tropical Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/yogurt-smoothie-11419\" title=\"Yogurt Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yogurt Smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831135542\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.131 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 960/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7409/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1284/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 853192/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   86.691      1 -total\n 72.39%   62.756      1 Template:Infobox\n 31.76%   27.534      9 Template:Infoicon\n 15.82%   13.716      1 Template:Navigation\n  7.30%    6.329      1 Template:SmoothieMixerMenu\n  5.19%    4.497      1 Template:NavMenu\n  3.28%    2.844      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  3.25%    2.814      1 Template:Languages\n  2.75%    2.387      9 Template:BigIcon\n  1.80%    1.562      4 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:11418-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831135542 and revision id 107273. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
